removeSession.t.sol
└── when permissionId is EMPTY_PERMISSIONID
│   └── it should revert with InvalidSession
└── when permissionId is not EMPTY_PERMISSIONID
    ├── when permission is not enabled for caller
    │   └── it should complete without changes (no session to remove)
    ├── when permission is enabled for caller
    │   ├── when session has no action policies
    │   │   └── it should remove session and validator, emit SessionRemoved
    │   ├── when session has action policies
    │   │   ├── when session has single action policy
    │   │   │   └── it should remove all policies and session, emit SessionRemoved
    │   │   └── when session has multiple action policies
    │   │       └── it should remove all policies and session, emit SessionRemoved
    │   └── when session has session validator
    │       └── it should disable validator and remove session, emit SessionRemoved
    └── when permissionId is valid but session doesn't exist
        └── it should complete without changes